# IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin working directory: the test sandbox, downloaded
# product releases, the layout index and the generated Ivy descriptors. ~200 MB and
# tied to one IDE build number, and the descriptors are regenerated with different
# XML formatting every run, so tracking them produces pure churn.
# Verified regenerable: wiping the whole directory and running `test` rebuilds it
# and passes 36/36.
